Spec: Independent Windows registration sample

Purpose:
  Demonstrate a trusted development launch, pending registration and operation lookup in an SDK-only consumer.

Owns:
  ./Registration.Sample.csproj
  ./Program.cs
  ./README.md
  ./verify.ps1

Must:
  Require an operator-trusted Broker artifact directory, executable digest, state directory, manifest path and persistent operation UUID.
  Verify the supplied digest while holding the executable file open, then pin only the process launched by the sample.
  Close only the owned Broker and print registration/query results without paths or credentials.
  Depend on the client SDK without Broker or SQLite assemblies.
  In explicit query mode, query only the saved operation and never register again.
